  "solution": "**Calculation:**\n\ndfrac {(0.0002)² + (0.0033)² + (0.0444)²} {(0.00002)² + (0.00033)² + (0.00444)²}\n\n⇒ dfrac{[(0.0002)²+(0.0033)²+(0.0444)²]}{dfrac{1}{10²}[(0.0002)²+(0.0033)²+(0.0444)²]}\n\n⇒ dfrac{10²[(0.0002)²+(0.0033)²+(0.0444)²]}{[(0.0002)²+(0.0033)²+(0.0444)²]}\n\n⇒ 10² = 100\n\n**Therefore, the value of the given expression is 100.**",
